      "content": "The fire in the brazier is dying... everything is just so cold. I look at my hands and all I see is the blood of the men I swore to protect. I led them into a slaughterhouse because of my own pride. There is no way to fix this. There is no way to ever be a commander again after this. I've lost my honor, my soul... I'm just a ghost walking among the living now.",
